                        "tags": [
                            "印度"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "c963be59-dafe-419d-abb1-b8e1e509e7de",
                                "sense_id": "c8c71a7b-a5bd-394e-af85-08a27bd86c3f",
                                "text": "There is a dreary bustee in the neighbourhood which is said to make the most of any cholera that may be going.",
                                "translation": "附近有一所阴暗的贫民窟，据说这里是霍乱爆发的最主要地点。"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "10d0eca2-2870-4a21-ae17-be8b300065df",
                                "sense_id": "c8c71a7b-a5bd-394e-af85-08a27bd86c3f",
                                "text": "With the population growth in the jhopadpattis, favelas, bastis and bidonvilles higher than any other environment in the world, we are seeing the emergence of Megaslums, where one million urban poor live in an area measuring just 1.5 square miles.",
                                "translation": "由于各种贫民窟和小城镇的人口增长速度高于世界上任何其他地区，我们看到了巨型贫民窟的出现，在面积仅为1.5平方英里的区域内居住着一百万城市贫民。"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "5e7c889c-46a5-4bc3-8d67-42cd90968f23",
                                "sense_id": "c8c71a7b-a5bd-394e-af85-08a27bd86c3f",
                                "text": "Her mother-in-law, in her half-delirious state, was sure that their basti would be broken down and had aggressively begun to push her sons to buy a plot of land elsewhere.",
                                "translation": "她半昏迷的婆婆确信他们所居住的贫民窟会被拆毁，并开始积极敦促她的儿子们去其他地方购买一块土地。"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
